  "text_items": [
    {
      "text": "硕士论文 / AI 编译器面试",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 56,
      "baseline_y": 48,
      "width": 264.0
    },
    {
      "text": "从一段 matmul MLIR，到真实微内核执行",
      "font_size": 46,
      "x": 56,
      "baseline_y": 105,
      "width": 828.0
    },
    {
      "text": "沿代码的变化讲论文：主线展示编译与执行，上方标出调度控制和研究落点。",
      "font_size": 27,
      "x": 56,
      "baseline_y": 151,
      "width": 918.0
    },
    {
      "text": "A—D：论文研究 / 实现",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 83,
      "baseline_y": 193,
      "width": 220.5
    },
    {
      "text": "灰色：复用的编译基础设施",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 397,
      "baseline_y": 193,
      "width": 252.0
    },
    {
      "text": "紫色虚线：调度控制 / 测量反馈",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 788,
      "baseline_y": 193,
      "width": 304.5
    },
    {
      "text": "主例：BLIS f32 6×16",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1510,
      "baseline_y": 193,
      "width": 230.0
    },
    {
      "text": "A  调用知识建模",
      "font_size": 29,
      "x": 76,
      "baseline_y": 256,
      "width": 217.5
    },
    {
      "text": "库源码 → Fact → Contract / Profile",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 76,
      "baseline_y": 294,
      "width": 396.0
    },
    {
      "text": "硬条件：ISA / 布局 / tail / ABI",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 76,
      "baseline_y": 327,
      "width": 356.5
    },
    {
      "text": "软偏好：分块与排序；保留来源和版本",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 76,
      "baseline_y": 359,
      "width": 374.0
    },
    {
      "text": "B  Contract 驱动的候选空间",
      "font_size": 29,
      "x": 552,
      "baseline_y": 256,
      "width": 377.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Task + Contract → 约束检查 / 活性分析 / 去重",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 552,
      "baseline_y": 294,
      "width": 517.5
    },
    {
      "text": "direct / adapt / fallback / reject",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 552,
      "baseline_y": 327,
      "width": 391.0
    },
    {
      "text": "输出：候选 token、分块参数、生成义务与诊断",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 552,
      "baseline_y": 359,
      "width": 462.0
    },
    {
      "text": "BaCO 选择候选",
      "font_size": 27,
      "x": 1158,
      "baseline_y": 256,
      "width": 175.5
    },
    {
      "text": "复用搜索器",
      "font_size": 24,
      "x": 1158,
      "baseline_y": 296,
      "width": 120.0
    },
    {
      "text": "选中有效 token",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1158,
      "baseline_y": 332,
      "width": 161.0
    },
    {
      "text": "按目标耗时搜索",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 1158,
      "baseline_y": 362,
      "width": 154.0
    },
    {
      "text": "D  联合验证与成本评价",
      "font_size": 28,
      "x": 1446,
      "baseline_y": 256,
      "width": 294.0
    },
    {
      "text": "数值 / IR / 符号 / 实际运行路径",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 1446,
      "baseline_y": 294,
      "width": 341.0
    },
    {
      "text": "目标计时回传；完整库与全成本对照",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 1446,
      "baseline_y": 327,
      "width": 352.0
    },
    {
      "text": "回答：调用是否成立，搜索是否值得",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 1446,
      "baseline_y": 359,
      "width": 352.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Transform IR：描述“如何变换”的调度程序",
      "font_size": 24,
      "x": 370,
      "baseline_y": 446,
      "width": 480.0
    },
    {
      "text": "bufferize → packing pass → 绑定微内核调用",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 370,
      "baseline_y": 474,
      "width": 473.0
    },
    {
      "text": "选中 token → 填入参数",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 1052,
      "baseline_y": 441,
      "width": 231.0
    },
    {
      "text": "调度程序控制下方 IR 变换",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 1052,
      "baseline_y": 474,
      "width": 252.0
    },
    {
      "text": "程序编译与执行主链",
      "font_size": 24,
      "x": 56,
      "baseline_y": 515,
      "width": 216.0
    },
    {
      "text": "1  Tensor matmul",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 208.0
    },
    {
      "text": "2  缓冲区化",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 143.0
    },
    {
      "text": "3  微内核接入 [C]",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 221.0
    },
    {
      "text": "4  标准 lowering",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 208.0
    },
    {
      "text": "5  编译与链接",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 169.0
    },
    {
      "text": "6  CPU 运行",
      "font_size": 26,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 575,
      "width": 143.0
    },
    {
      "text": "%0 = linalg.matmul",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 628,
      "width": 207.0
    },
    {
      "text": "  ins(%A, %B : ...)",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 664,
      "width": 209.0
    },
    {
      "text": "  outs(%C : ...)",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 700,
      "width": 176.0
    },
    {
      "text": "  -> tensor<?x?xf32>",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 736,
      "width": 220.0
    },
    {
      "text": "输入：矩阵乘加的计算语义",
      "font_size": 19,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 788,
      "width": 228.0
    },
    {
      "text": "尚未指定 packing 与微内核",
      "font_size": 18,
      "x": 72,
      "baseline_y": 816,
      "width": 225.0
    },
    {
      "text": "tensor → memref",
      "font_size": 24,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 628,
      "width": 192.0
    },
    {
      "text": "linalg.matmul",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 666,
      "width": 149.5
    },
    {
      "text": "操作内存中的 A/B/C",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 702,
      "width": 198.0
    },
    {
      "text": "memref<?x?xf32>",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 738,
      "width": 172.5
    },
    {
      "text": "one_shot_bufferize",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 788,
      "width": 189.0
    },
    {
      "text": "复用 MLIR 缓冲区化",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 366,
      "baseline_y": 816,
      "width": 180.0
    },
    {
      "text": "(a) packing / fringe pass",
      "font_size": 24,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 626,
      "width": 300.0
    },
    {
      "text": "SCF 循环 + A/B panel packing",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 659,
      "width": 308.0
    },
    {
      "text": "生成 direct / fringe 占位调用",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 692,
      "width": 319.0
    },
    {
      "text": "(b) Transform op 绑定 callee",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 735,
      "width": 308.0
    },
    {
      "text": "func.call @BLIS_wrapper(...)",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 770,
      "width": 308.0
    },
    {
      "text": "产物：SCF / MemRef / Arith / func.call",
      "font_size": 18,
      "x": 638,
      "baseline_y": 815,
      "width": 342.0
    },
    {
      "text": "SCF → CF",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 626,
      "width": 112.5
    },
    {
      "text": "MemRef / func / arith",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 662,
      "width": 210.0
    },
    {
      "text": "→ LLVM dialect",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 698,
      "width": 187.5
    },
    {
      "text": "    ↓ mlir-translate",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 734,
      "width": 210.0
    },
    {
      "text": "LLVM IR (.ll)",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 770,
      "width": 162.5
    },
    {
      "text": "复用标准转换与翻译工具",
      "font_size": 19,
      "x": 1044,
      "baseline_y": 816,
      "width": 209.0
    },
    {
      "text": "clang++ -O3",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 626,
      "width": 137.5
    },
    {
      "text": "LLVM IR + driver",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 664,
      "width": 184.0
    },
    {
      "text": "+ ABI adapter [C]",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 702,
      "width": 195.5
    },
    {
      "text": "+ libblis.a",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 740,
      "width": 137.5
    },
    {
      "text": "→ 可执行文件",
      "font_size": 25,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 778,
      "width": 162.5
    },
    {
      "text": "adapter 对接 BLIS ABI",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 1330,
      "baseline_y": 816,
      "width": 210.0
    },
    {
      "text": "driver 调用 GEMM",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 626,
      "width": 184.0
    },
    {
      "text": "→ ABI adapter [C]",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 664,
      "width": 207.0
    },
    {
      "text": "→ BLIS 6×16 微内核",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 702,
      "width": 230.0
    },
    {
      "text": "输出 C + 执行耗时",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 740,
      "width": 195.5
    },
    {
      "text": "记录真实调用与边界路径",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 778,
      "width": 231.0
    },
    {
      "text": "微内核本体由 BLIS 提供",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 1616,
      "baseline_y": 816,
      "width": 220.0
    },
    {
      "text": "运行证据",
      "font_size": 22,
      "x": 1747,
      "baseline_y": 454,
      "width": 88.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Fallback：通用 tiling / 可选 vectorization",
      "font_size": 23,
      "x": 330,
      "baseline_y": 900,
      "width": 483.0
    },
    {
      "text": "先在 tensor 上调度，再 bufferization；接回标准 lowering",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 330,
      "baseline_y": 931,
      "width": 577.5
    },
    {
      "text": "路径由 B 判定；reject 在候选阶段停止，不进入编译执行。",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 57,
      "baseline_y": 968,
      "width": 540.0
    },
    {
      "text": "真实被调用的库内符号：",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 1240,
      "baseline_y": 883,
      "width": 231.0
    },
    {
      "text": "bli_sgemm_haswell_asm_6x16",
      "font_size": 27,
      "x": 1240,
      "baseline_y": 918,
      "width": 351.0
    },
    {
      "text": "尾块由生成代码处理；wrapper 对接 ABI",
      "font_size": 21,
      "x": 1240,
      "baseline_y": 946,
      "width": 378.0
    },
    {
      "text": "论文落点：在通用 lowering 前生成可调用的候选并物化微内核接入；在执行后验证路径、性能与搜索成本。",
      "font_size": 27,
      "x": 78,
      "baseline_y": 1018,
      "width": 1296.0
    },
    {
      "text": "图中 IR 为节选示意。BLIS f64 复用核心生成逻辑；OpenBLAS RVV 保留包内生成与适配，不能套用此 BLIS pass。",
      "font_size": 20,
      "x": 56,
      "baseline_y": 1070,
      "width": 1020.0
    }
  ],
